## Structure and boundaries

The engine and the activation workflow come from the skeleton revision above and
are not edited here; definitions, client and modules are product-owned.
`foundata.utils` owns byte transport, deadlines, JSON decoding and safe error
translation. Inventory is development-only. The core floor is 2.19 because
shared playbooks use FQCN Jinja builtins; payload Python remains 3.9.

